.TH HELP 1
.SH NAME
help \- the shell's commands
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B help
is a command built into the shell,
.BR sh (1).
It lists the built-in commands, each with its arguments and a few words,
and a few common programs
.RB ( fetch ,
.BR ping ).
Any other word runs a program,
.BI /bin/ name\fR,
or a path with a
.BR / .
Each command has a page here:
.B man
.IR name .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR man (1),
.BR sh (1),
.BR intro (1)
